# Fast physical mapping for memory-heavy ShamaOS partitions.
# Preserve exact sequential behavior, map memories to logic, then convert the
# combinational network directly to an AND-inverter graph without ABC.

proc
flatten
opt
fsm
opt
memory_map
opt
techmap
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
opt
simplemap
# simplemap materializes internal $_SDFF_* cells for synchronous-reset state.
# Unmap them once more so the physical netlist only needs a plain DFF plus
# combinational reset gating, which aigmap reduces to AND/NOT.
dffunmap
opt
aigmap
opt
clean -purge
